  "reference_answer": "The proposal is to approach AI-safety research with academic technical rigor and bring it into academia, including topics outside the current academic mainstream. Meeting academic standards makes it easier to judge whether research is producing meaningful progress, reducing uncertainty about whether an apparent advance is genuine. It also makes the work more accessible for the broader machine-learning community to take up.",
